#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:4
msgid "Библиотека ecos-camel-core"
msgstr "ecos-camel-core Library"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:6
msgid ""
"Библиотека является надстройкой над Apache Camel, которая адаптирована "
"для работы с платформой Citeck."
msgstr ""
"The library is an extension built on top of Apache Camel, adapted for "
"working with the Citeck platform."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:10
msgid "Для работы с библиотекой необходима enterprise лицензия."
msgstr "An enterprise license is required to use the library."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:13
msgid "Подключение"
msgstr "Setup"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:15
msgid "Добавьте зависимость в нужном микросервисе:"
msgstr "Add the dependency to the required microservice:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:24
msgid "Подходящая версия будет загружена из родительского POM."
msgstr "The appropriate version will be downloaded from the parent POM."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:27
msgid "Пример использования"
msgstr "Usage Example"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:29
msgid ""
"Создайте компонент с настройками роутов. Он запустит новый контекст после"
" старта приложения:"
msgstr ""
"Create a component with route configurations that will launch a new "
"context after the application starts:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:123
msgid "Пример демонстрирует следующий сценарий:"
msgstr "The example demonstrates the following scenario:"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:125
msgid ""
"При старте приложения через ``@PostConstruct`` создаётся и запускается "
"новый ``EcosCamelContext``."
msgstr ""
"When the application starts, a new ``EcosCamelContext`` is created and "
"launched via ``@PostConstruct``."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:126
msgid ""
"Роут подписывается на событие ``record-created`` по типу ``demo-type``, "
"извлекая нужные атрибуты записи."
msgstr ""
"The route subscribes to the ``record-created`` event of type "
"``demo-type``, extracting the required record attributes."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:127
msgid ""
"В ``process``-шаге формируется новый объект с полями, необходимыми для "
"создания записи в целевом источнике."
msgstr ""
"In the ``process`` step, a new object is formed with the fields required "
"to create a record in the target source."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:128
msgid ""
"Результат передаётся в endpoint ``ecos-records-mutate``, который создаёт "
"новую сущность в ``emodel/demo-type-2``."
msgstr ""
"The result is passed to the ``ecos-records-mutate`` endpoint, which "
"creates a new entity in ``emodel/demo-type-2``."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:129
msgid ""
"При остановке приложения контекст корректно завершается в методе "
"``destroy()``."
msgstr ""
"When the application stops, the context is properly terminated in the "
"``destroy()`` method."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/ecos-camel-core.rst:133
msgid ":ref:`Endpoint ecos-records-mutate <EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>`"
msgstr "More about :ref:`ecos-records-mutate<EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>`"

